<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown changes Focus List.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown changes Focus List.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it removed State Street Boston Corp and CIDCO Inc from its Focus List and added EMC Corp to the list.</p>
<p>-- State Street was unchanged at 73-1/8, CIDCO gained 1/8 to 13, and EMC added 7/8 to 38-3/4.</p>
</text>
